    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This repository contains data for the publication: Stephanie A Gagnon, Michael L Waskom, Thackery I Brown, Anthony D Wagner, Stress Impairs Episodic Retrieval by Disrupting Hippocampal and Cortical Mechanisms of Remembering, Cerebral Cortex, Volume 29, Issue 7, July 2019, Pages 2947–2964, https://doi.org/10.1093/cercor/bhy162. The data includes (a) design files and masks, (b) extracted fMRI data from masks, and (c) preprocessed fMRI data.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Sorenson, S. (2024). Data for Gagnon et al “Stress Impairs Episodic Retrieval by Disrupting Hippocampal and Cortical Mechanisms of Remembering” 2019. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/by550md4895. https://doi.org/10.25740/by550md4895.",
